Description: avcodec/amf: refuse stereo metadata that cannot be signalled
 .
 AMF has no general SEI payload insertion route in the current encoder API.
 Reject marked frames and initial decoded side data with a diagnostic that
 names the packing and explains the frame_packing=0 opt-out. Keep ordinary
 2D unchanged and expose the option with the same default as other encoders.
 .
 Both encoder guards and their explicit opt-outs were exercised before
 runtime initialization. The encoders compile; AMF runtime encoding is
 not qualified by these guard tests.
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
